전달 자료: 새 개정 검토 대상</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:documentation textFormat="application/vnd.artwork.metadata+json">{"actor":"QS팀"}</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:documentation textFormat="application/vnd.artwork.review-context+json">{"inputs":"완료 후 발견한 수정사항","outputs":"새 개정 검토 대상","businessRules":[],"perspective":"tobe","phase":"Phase 1","functionIds":["B-02","K-접수-10"],"sourceRefs":[{"path":"docs/20_회의록_2026-09-22.md","ref":"허가 후 바코드 부여·입고 전후 후속 조치"},{"path":"docs/23_업무규칙장부.md","ref":"허가-11·차수-13·차수-14·차수-22·바코-07·단계-34"},{"path":"docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-25-artwork-phase1-functional-design.md","ref":"T-11·T-13·T-18·K-대조-18·21·K-검토-08~11"},{"path":"CODEX.md","ref":"늦은 허가·바코드는 독립된 후속 업무"}],"workflowId":"WF11","originalStepId":"WF11_T06","actorDetail":"QS 담당자"}</bpmn:documentation>
